    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense, but the \"hidden\" part is what's really worrying me. If there were assets that were intentionally kept off the books or just weren't disclosed by the executors, does HMRC treat that as a simple mistake or something more serious? I'm trying to figure out if we're looking at a technical error or if we're going to run into issues with intent.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
